<h2>

Why This Skill Matters

</h2>

<p>

Most climbers spend more time getting
into the tree than they do climbing it.

A properly placed throwline can reduce
setup time dramatically while also
making climbing safer and more efficient.

</p>

<p>

Professional arborists rely on throwline
skills every day because access determines
how efficiently every following task can be completed.

</p>

